{title: Whatever It Takes}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]There's a voice calling me from an [G]old rugged [D]tree
And it [D]whispers
"Draw [E]closer to [A]Me
Leave this [D]world far behind
There are [G]new heights to [Emaj7]climb
And a [D]new life in [A]Me you will [D]find"

{comment: Chorus}
For what[D]ever it takes to draw [G]closer to [D]You, Lord
